>>
Rule 1 (input tensor x must have a permitted numeric/complex dtype: not bool)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10
>>
Rule 2 (explicitly forbid boolean dtype for x)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 0 then false
>>
Rule 3 (tensor shape dimensions are non-negative or x is a scalar)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 0) ∨ (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0)
>>
Rule 4 (name, if provided, is a string)
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 = v_2
